<p data-start=3D"3565" data-end=3D"3772" class=3D"">Le s=C3=A9rialiseur <co=
de data-start=3D"3580" data-end=3D"3596">PostSerializer</code> est tr=C3=A8=
s simple. Il suffit de d=C3=A9clarer la classe, d'associer le mod=C3=A8le <=
