<h3 data-start=3D"9945" data-end=3D"9999" class=3D"">4.3 Cas d'utilisation =
de la pagination par curseur</h3>
<p data-start=3D"10001" data-end=3D"10066" class=3D"">La pagination par cur=
seur est particuli=C3=A8rement adapt=C3=A9e pour les :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"10067" data-end=3D"10283">
<li data-start=3D"10067" data-end=3D"10167" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"10069" data-end=3D"10167" class=3D"">Ensembles de donn=C3=
=A9es dynamiques o=C3=B9 les =C3=A9l=C3=A9ments sont r=C3=A9guli=C3=A8remen=
t ajout=C3=A9s, modifi=C3=A9s ou supprim=C3=A9s.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"10168" data-end=3D"10283" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"10170" data-end=3D"10283" class=3D"">Applications o=C3=B9 =
l'ordre des =C3=A9l=C3=A9ments est important et o=C3=B9 la pagination doit =
=C3=AAtre stable malgr=C3=A9 les modifications.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"10285" data-end=3D"10288" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"10290" data-end=3D"10339" class=3D"">5. Comparer les diff=
=C3=A9rents types de pagination</h2>
<div class=3D"overflow-x-auto contain-inline-size"><table data-start=3D"103=
41" data-end=3D"11229" node=3D"[object Object]"><thead data-start=3D"10341"=
 data-end=3D"10499"><tr data-start=3D"10341" data-end=3D"10499"><th data-st=
art=3D"10341" data-end=3D"10372"><strong data-start=3D"10343" data-end=3D"1=
0365">Type de pagination</strong></th><th data-start=3D"10372" data-end=3D"=
10412"><strong data-start=3D"10374" data-end=3D"10387">Avantages</strong></=
th><th data-start=3D"10412" data-end=3D"10451"><strong data-start=3D"10414"=
 data-end=3D"10431">Inconv=C3=A9nients</strong></th><th data-start=3D"10451=
" data-end=3D"10499"><strong data-start=3D"10453" data-end=3D"10483">Cas d'=
utilisation typiques</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody data-start=3D"10658" =
data-end=3D"11229"><tr data-start=3D"10658" data-end=3D"10848"><td><strong =
data-start=3D"10660" data-end=3D"10684">PageNumberPagination</strong></td><=
td>Simple, facile =C3=A0 comprendre</td><td>Moins flexible, ne convient pas=
 aux donn=C3=A9es dynamiques</td><td>Petites =C3=A0 moyennes quantit=C3=A9s=
 de donn=C3=A9es, pagination simple</td></tr><tr data-start=3D"10849" data-=
end=3D"11034"><td><strong data-start=3D"10851" data-end=3D"10876">LimitOffs=
etPagination</strong></td><td>Plus flexible, meilleure personnalisation</td=
><td>Moins robuste avec des ensembles de donn=C3=A9es dynamiques</td><td>Ap=
