<p data-start=3D"2333" data-end=3D"2474" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
333" data-end=3D"2352">Filtres de base</strong> comme <code data-start=3D"2=
359" data-end=3D"2373">SearchFilter</code>, <code data-start=3D"2375" data-=
end=3D"2391">OrderingFilter</code>, et <code data-start=3D"2396" data-end=
=3D"2417">DjangoFilterBackend</code> qui sont g=C3=A9n=C3=A9ralement suffis=
ants pour des cas standards.</p>
</li>
